{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"nonisolated","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"override","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"id","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ID","preciseIdentifier":"s:s12IdentifiableP2IDQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Identifiable\/ID-swift.associatedtype"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Many distributed actor references may be pointing at, logically, the same actor."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For example, calling "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"resolve(id:using:)"},{"type":"text","text":" multiple times, is not guaranteed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to return the same exact resolved actor instance, however all the references would"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"represent logically references to the same distributed actor, e.g. on a different node."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Depending on the capabilities of the actor system producing the identifiers,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ID"},{"type":"text","text":" may also be used to store instance specific metadata."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Synthesized property","anchor":"Synthesized-property","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In concrete distributed actor declarations, a witness for this protocol requirement is synthesized by the compiler."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is not possible to 